  m_Name: MonikaThrowsHandsWithAssassins
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Eep-!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136301356379799668
    - rid: 6136301356379799669
    - rid: 6136301356379799670
    - rid: 6136301356379799671
    - rid: 6136301356379799672
    - rid: 6136301356379799682
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Monika narrowly dodges a waraxe trying to cleave her in two.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (<NoiseText=2,1>{Player}, help!!!</NoiseText>)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136301356379799674
    - rid: 7022832773468782648
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136301356379799677
    - rid: 6136301356379799678
    - rid: 6136301356379799679
    - rid: 6136301356379799680
    - rid: 6136301356379799681
    - rid: 6136301356379799675
    - rid: 6136301356379799676
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Haaahh... haaahh... (Oh man...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7022832707537731588
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: There's no time to rest, captain- get your guard up!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7022832707537731589
    - rid: 7022832707537731590
    - rid: 7022832707537731591
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, righ-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7022832707537731592
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Waah-!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7022832707537731593
    - rid: 7022832707537731594
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7022832707537731595
    - rid: 7022832707537731596
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1d5445b47c4c3bf46bc553f59490f6ed, type: 2}
    dialog: You made a big mistake coming here, girl.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7022832707537731597
    - rid: 7022832707537731598
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1d5445b47c4c3bf46bc553f59490f6ed, type: 2}
    dialog: As thanks for killing my husband, I'll make sure you'll live long enough
      to get eaten alive by Lis.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Wha-?!?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7022832707537731599
    - rid: 7022832707537731600
    - rid: 7022832707537731602
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7022832729979879481
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (I-)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (I don't think I was ready for this.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Gahhh...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7022832729979879483
    - rid: 7022832729979879484
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (It's a good thing you came when you did, {Player}, ahaha...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7022832729979879485
    - rid: 7022832729979879486
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (I'm sure you could guess based on what's happening, but-)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7022832729979879487
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Yeah, that Maro guy decided it was time to storm the sanctuary.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7022832729979879488
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Which, in retrospect, was a bit foolhardy of him.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7022832729979879489
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (After you left I saw a handful more people enter the sanctuary-)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7022832729979879490
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (And after I reported that to Maro, he was like:)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7022832729979879491
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ("Then there are less than we expected!")
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7022832729979879492
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ("If we just requisition the guard from the Falkreath, we'll be able
      to slay those monsters!")
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7022832729979879493
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (I bet you can see how that's going.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (We managed to charge in, but-)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7022832729979879494
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (They must've seen this coming because they started attacking only after
      we were all in the sanctuary.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7022832729979879495
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 308d62972f3bcf945b9d9cd147348a86, type: 2}
    dialog: Grraaahh-!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7022832729979879496
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (... we should probably go help them out.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7022832729979879497
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (As overpowered having <b>you</b> on our side is-)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7022832729979879498
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (I'd rather not go against a whole sect of assassins by myself!)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7022832729979879499
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (... by <i>ourselves</i>?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7022832729979879500
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7022832773468782657
    - rid: 7022832773468782658
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7022832773468782659
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 308d62972f3bcf945b9d9cd147348a86, type: 2}
    dialog: Help me! The lizar-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 308d62972f3bcf945b9d9cd147348a86, type: 2}
    dialog: Grk-!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7022832773468782661
    - rid: 7022832773468782662
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 84e4c882fd8bdcf4493f97d343789b06, type: 2}
    dialog: Not a one of you defilers shall leave this Sanctuary alive.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7022832773468782663
    - rid: 7022832773468782664
    - rid: 7022832773468782665
